==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkakə/|lang=de}}

===Etymology===
Similar to {{etyl|la|-}} ''[[cacare]]'', {{etyl|grc|-}} {{term|κακκάω||sc=polytonic|tr=kakkaō|lang=grc}}, but possibly not directly related to these, instead [[onomatopoeic]], relating to the sound a baby makes when pressing while defecating (“a-a-”).

